{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13211150","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13211150","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1321115001:0":{"text":"I think I've gathered a lot of valuable insights!","source_cn":"问了这么多人，感觉收集到了不少值得参考的答案呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9AE2A2C06BDB859","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321115002:0":{"text":"Among the answers are the Whiteridge Temple, Petalia Plains, the Frozen Paw, and Cedartown during the festival... Hmm, everyone has different ideas!","source_cn":"我记得有白山大教堂、繁花原野、白熊温泉旅店，还有举办祭...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B3C7923C12E26CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1321115002":{"text":"Among the answers are the Whiteridge Temple, Petalia Plains, the Frozen Paw, and Cedartown during the festival... Hmm, everyone has different ideas!","source_cn":"我记得有白山大教堂、繁花原野、白熊温泉旅店，还有举办祭典时的雪松镇……唔，每个人的想法都不一样呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B3C7923C12E26CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321115004:1":{"text":"No matter what, at least I have some ideas now. The land of blessing might be one of them!","source_cn":"不管怎么样，至少这些答案给了我一些思路。说不定女神祝福...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66B7C6C8A73902DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321115005:1":{"text":"Since it's the Snowspire Festival, I'm thinking of taking a stroll around town to soak up the festive vibe. After all, it's the go-to place at the moment.","source_cn":"刚好是冬日祭典期间，我准备在镇上四处逛一逛，体验一下祭...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7574D8429E76340B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321115006:1":{"text":"Who knows? I might stumble upon the most beautiful scenery soon!","source_cn":"说不定，用不了多久，我就能找到传说中的最美风景了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6270B0E5E3999F10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321115007:0":{"text":"I hope everything goes well for you!","source_cn":"那就祝你一路顺利啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA4963BEBD247A79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321115008:1":{"text":"Do let us know when you find the place!","source_cn":"要是你真的找到了那个地方，记得要告诉我们一声！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38F1B53AF6598F54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321115009:1":{"text":"You bet!","source_cn":"当然，我一定会记得的~","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2CB0FC91FEC7BE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"It's a test indeed.","source_cn":"难怪是一种考验","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x01510B147EF4CAD5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's a test indeed.","female":"It's a test indeed.","variant_male_record_index":"69320","variant_female_record_index":"69321","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321115003:1":{"text":"There's no such place in the Duchy of Whiteridge. I can't take that guy's opinion into account even if I wanted to.","source_cn":"白山公国里没有这样的地方，即使想算上它也不行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7F8FDCD5BAC3908","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"What about a research facility?","source_cn":"不算上机械研究所吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1C561D2614EC3061","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What about a research facility?","female":"What about a research facility?","variant_male_record_index":"69322","variant_female_record_index":"69323","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:娜塔莎":{"text":"Natasha","source":"娜塔莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":3}}